// Мартах муруй: давтахгүй бол мэдлэг хурдан буурна; 1-3-7-14-30 хоногт сануулга очиж, давтах бүрт сэргэнэ.
const REV = [1, 3, 7, 14, 30], STAB = [0.9, 2.2, 5, 11, 24, 60];
const retention = (d, reviews) => { let k = 0; while (k < reviews.length && reviews[k] <= d) k++; const r0 = k ? reviews[k - 1] : 0; return 0.2 + 0.8 * Math.exp(-(d - r0) / STAB[k]); };
let curveP = 0, rang = -1;
const curveTex = canvasTex(512, 320, (c, w, h) => {
  c.fillStyle = "#0f1838"; rrect(c, 0, 0, w, h, 20); c.fill();
  c.fillStyle = "#fff"; c.font = `800 20px ${FONT}`; c.fillText("Мартах муруй", 22, 34);
  c.fillStyle = "#8a96bf"; c.font = `600 12px ${FONT}`; c.fillText("Давтах бүрт санах ой сэргэж, удаан хадгалагдана", 22, 54);
  const L = 54, R = w - 24, T = 78, Bt = h - 46, xd = (d) => L + (Math.sqrt(d) / Math.sqrt(30)) * (R - L), yr = (r) => Bt - r * (Bt - T);
  c.strokeStyle = "rgba(255,255,255,.12)"; c.lineWidth = 1; [0.25, 0.5, 0.75, 1].forEach((r) => { c.beginPath(); c.moveTo(L, yr(r)); c.lineTo(R, yr(r)); c.stroke(); });
  c.fillStyle = "#8a96bf"; c.font = `600 11px ${FONT}`; c.fillText("100%", 14, yr(1) + 4); c.fillText("50%", 20, yr(0.5) + 4);
  [0, 1, 3, 7, 14, 30].forEach((d) => { c.fillText(d ? d + " хоног" : "Үзсэн", xd(d) - (d ? 16 : 14), Bt + 22); });
  c.setLineDash([5, 5]); c.strokeStyle = "rgba(255,255,255,.35)"; c.lineWidth = 2; c.beginPath();
  for (let i = 0; i <= 120; i++) { const d = (i / 120) * 30; c[i ? "lineTo" : "moveTo"](xd(d), yr(retention(d, []))); } c.stroke(); c.setLineDash([]);
  c.fillStyle = "rgba(255,255,255,.45)"; c.fillText("давтахгүй бол", xd(9), yr(0.27));
  const end = curveP * 30;
  c.strokeStyle = "#ff6fae"; c.lineWidth = 4; c.lineJoin = "round"; c.beginPath();
  for (let i = 0; i <= 300; i++) { const d = (i / 300) * 30; if (d > end) break; const x = xd(d), y = yr(retention(d, REV)); if (!i) c.moveTo(x, y); else { if (REV.some((rv) => rv <= d && rv > ((i - 1) / 300) * 30)) c.lineTo(x, yr(retention(d - 0.0001, REV))); c.lineTo(x, y); } }
  c.stroke();
  REV.forEach((rv) => { const x = xd(rv), on = rv <= end; c.fillStyle = on ? "#ffd23f" : "rgba(255,255,255,.18)"; c.beginPath(); c.arc(x, T - 6, 9, 0, 7); c.fill(); c.fillStyle = on ? "#1d1300" : "#0f1838"; c.font = `800 10px ${FONT}`; c.textAlign = "center"; c.fillText(rv, x, T - 2); c.textAlign = "left"; });
  const ex = xd(end), ey = yr(retention(end, REV)); c.fillStyle = "#fff"; c.beginPath(); c.arc(ex, ey, 6, 0, 7); c.fill();
  if (rang >= 0) { const x = Math.min(xd(REV[rang]), R - 120); c.fillStyle = "#ffd23f"; rrect(c, x, T + 8, 118, 26, 13); c.fill(); c.fillStyle = "#1d1300"; c.font = `800 12px ${FONT}`; c.fillText("19:00 · Давтаарай!", x + 10, T + 25); }
});
const curve = billboard(3.3, 2.06, curveTex, HEX.pink); at(curve, 16.4, 0.25, 1.2); curve.rotation.y = -0.6; S.add(curve);
const bellS = iconSprite("bell", "#ff6fae", 0.7); at(bellS, 1.75, 3.55, 0.1); curve.add(bellS);
reg("curve", curve);
label("Мартах муруй", { at: [16.4, 3.85, 1.2], c: HEX.pink, sub: "1 · 3 · 7 · 14 · 30 хоногт сануулна", steps: ["review"], ov: "hover", node: "curve" });
let curveAcc = 0;
tickers.push((t, dt) => {
  curveP += dt / 9; if (curveP > 1.15) { curveP = 0; rang = -1; }
  const d = Math.min(1, curveP) * 30, hitR = REV.findIndex((rv) => Math.abs(rv - d) < 0.9 && d >= rv);
  if (hitR >= 0) rang = hitR;
  bellS.material.rotation = hitR >= 0 ? Math.sin(t * 28) * 0.35 : 0; bellS.scale.setScalar(hitR >= 0 ? 0.85 : 0.7);
  curveAcc += dt; if (curveAcc > 0.05) { curveAcc = 0; curveTex.userData.redraw(); }
});

